Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 5.4 04/24] riscv/atomic: Fix sign extension for RV64I
Date:   Tue, 23 Jun 2020 13:35:39 -0400
Message-Id: <20200623173559.1355728-4-sashal@kernel.org>
